    "name": "Nightborn",
    "steam_appid": 2509440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightborn is an Action RPG with narrative-focused gameplay set in a dark gothic version of our own world. <br>Players assume the role of the Bloodhound, a Vampire detective trained in tracking supernatural threats to the Nightborn, using arcane rituals forbidden to others of your kind.<br>Investigate a series of disappearances of your fellow Vampires, including your Maker, a politically influential member of the Nightborn, the Vampire elite of New Orleans. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bloodhound character, choosing from 10 iconic Vampire lineages with a set of signature lineage power skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lineage powers include physical prowess enhancements, shapeshifting, controlling the minds of mortals, and acts of eldritch sorcery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Vampire powers by preying upon mortals via stealth, seduction, or brute force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elude Mortal Law Enforcement and Monster Hunters, masking your dark nature.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of gothic New Orleans by taking quests, discovering clues, and exploring the supernatural underworld. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, evade, or outwit, natural and supernatural foes, using your powers, weapons, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side with a Nightborn faction, the ruling Establishment, the reckless Libertines, or the fanatical Orthodoxy; or eschew them all to forge your own path.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lycans, Horrors, and Cryptids, Oh My!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many mysteries to fear in the dark gothic world of Nightborn. Creatures beyond comprehension to discover, catalog, and, if you are skilled enough, survive.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Dialogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/10dd68f2357132683d4f80ba71901d4e.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what you say carefully. You may insult or befriend NPCs based on what you say. Gather information and keep your secrets close to your chest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is an excellent tool affording your Nightborn the ability to get the drop on Vampire Hunters or Supernatural foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush all who oppose you with fists, claws, melee weapons, or firearms! Or, optionally, show mercy. But where is the fun in that?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural power courses through your undead veins. Summon dark energies or boost your abilities beyond what mortals dream possible.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thirst</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding is required to sustain your undead form. Thankfully, Vampire Hunters are always making personal deliveries, with fresh &quot;donations&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gothic Night Clubs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your lost humanity by engaging in mortal activities. Public areas provide many feeding opportunities for the subtle and seductive.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightborn is an Action RPG with narrative-focused gameplay set in a dark gothic version of our own world. <br>Players assume the role of the Bloodhound, a Vampire detective trained in tracking supernatural threats to the Nightborn, using arcane rituals forbidden to others of your kind.<br>Investigate a series of disappearances of your fellow Vampires, including your Maker, a politically influential member of the Nightborn, the Vampire elite of New Orleans. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bloodhound character, choosing from 10 iconic Vampire lineages with a set of signature lineage power skill trees. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lineage powers include physical prowess enhancements, shapeshifting, controlling the minds of mortals, and acts of eldritch sorcery. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel Vampire powers by preying upon mortals via stealth, seduction, or brute force. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elude Mortal Law Enforcement and Monster Hunters, masking your dark nature.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of gothic New Orleans by taking quests, discovering clues, and exploring the supernatural underworld. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, evade, or outwit, natural and supernatural foes, using your powers, weapons, and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side with a Nightborn faction, the ruling Establishment, the reckless Libertines, or the fanatical Orthodoxy; or eschew them all to forge your own path.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lycans, Horrors, and Cryptids, Oh My!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/97b0a981e17cb4da4de49353e65739f5.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\