am/apps/2509440/extras/fc6047c7a42f9b0cd45c2d757fe42406.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth is an excellent tool affording your Nightborn the ability to get the drop on Vampire Hunters or Supernatural foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dominate your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/859205af987e8c665a2b205c1514c618.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush all who oppose you with fists, claws, melee weapons, or firearms! Or, optionally, show mercy. But where is the fun in that?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/1977fe79ff1f40034021a56ca8f5edc7.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural power courses through your undead veins. Summon dark energies or boost your abilities beyond what mortals dream possible.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Thirst</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/2a22e0d46c68d2fbb10ea9abe808dffd.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeding is required to sustain your undead form. Thankfully, Vampire Hunters are always making personal deliveries, with fresh &quot;donations&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gothic Night Clubs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.poster.avif?t=1754578987\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.webm?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509440/extras/0eaeb04fba6933a744381d455335c410.mp4?t=1754578987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with your lost humanity by engaging in mortal activities. Public areas provide many feeding opportunities for the subtle and seductive.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Fight, sneak, or charm your way through a gothic modern New Orleans as a Vampire detective of your creation. Unravel a vast centuries-old conspiracy involving Vampire factions, Werewolves, and far stranger horrors. Try to survive as a Nightborn without losing yourself to madness or damnation.",
